      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)" source="#source-40692-41192"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40695-40719"><rb>為朝</rb><rt>ためとも</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40719-40722">は</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40722-40737"><rb>鬼</rb><rt>おに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40737-40740">ガ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40740-40755"><rb>島</rb><rt>しま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40755-40758">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40758-40773"><rb>平</rb><rt>たい</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40773-40809">らげたついでに、ずんずん</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40809-40824"><rb>船</rb><rt>ふね</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40824-40857">をこぎすすめて、やがて</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40857-40875"><rb>伊豆</rb><rt>いず</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40875-40878">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40878-40902"><rb>島々</rb><rt>しまじま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40902-40905">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40905-40920"><rb>残</rb><rt>のこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40920-40926">らず</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40926-40947"><rb>自分</rb><rt>じぶん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40947-40950">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-40950-40977"><rb>領分</rb><rt>りょうぶん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-40977-41016">にしてしまいました。そして</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41016-41031"><rb>鬼</rb><rt>おに</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41031-41034">ガ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41034-41049"><rb>島</rb><rt>しま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41049-41055">から</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41055-41082"><rb>大男</rb><rt>おおおとこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41082-41085">を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-41085-41106"><rb>一人</rb><rt>ひとり</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-41106-41118">